.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-repo-transfer \- Transfer a repository to a new namespace.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab repo transfer [repo] [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Moves a project to a different group or user namespace. Specify the
destination with \fB--target-namespace\fR\&. You must have permission to
create projects in the target namespace.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-t\fP, \fB--target-namespace\fP=""
	The namespace where your project should be transferred to.

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	Warning: Skip confirmation prompt and force transfer operation. Transfer cannot be undone.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
glab repo transfer profclems/glab --target-namespace notprofclems
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-repo(1)\fP
